(3712709, 524047, 35352, '<td valign="top">I like the colours in the sky and rock though maybe a little oversaturated in the green trees. Its a good juxtaposition of Church and nature. It would be good to see just a little more horizontally down the bottom - the rocks seem a little cut of on the right.</td>', 'I like the colours in the sky and rock though maybe a little oversaturated in the green trees. Its a good juxtaposition of Church and nature. It would be good to see just a little more horizontally down the bottom - the rocks seem a little cut of on the right.', '2007-05-30 02:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
