(3712720, 521445, 19831, '<td valign="top">A very cool shot! I like how you''ve overexposed and blown out the light, works great. And just a perfect amount of negative space at top and bottom, not too much or too little. Makes for a well balanced, dynamic composition. Great job!</td>', 'A very cool shot! I like how you''ve overexposed and blown out the light, works great. And just a perfect amount of negative space at top and bottom, not too much or too little. Makes for a well balanced, dynamic composition. Great job!', '2007-05-30 02:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
