(3712858, 523422, 67145, '<td valign="top">your orientation and composition are excellent, i feel like i''m right underneath that amazing dome .. the clarity and detail is superb .. the colours are impressive .. like wow!!! .. =8</td>', 'your orientation and composition are excellent, i feel like i''m right underneath that amazing dome .. the clarity and detail is superb .. the colours are impressive .. like wow!!! .. =8', '2007-05-30 03:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3712864, 523175, 67145, '<td valign="top">this is scarey .. i hope you''re feeling a lot better now??!! ... looks like you''re looking in all the wrong places for your spiritual succour!! ..:) .. its not a ''pleasant'' image but you get across a very powerful message .. well, for me anyway .. =8</td>', 'this is scarey .. i hope you''re feeling a lot better now??!! ... looks like you''re looking in all the wrong places for your spiritual succour!! ..:) .. its not a ''pleasant'' image but you get across a very powerful message .. well, for me anyway .. =8', '2007-05-30 03:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3712865, 523566, 35352, '<td valign="top">Nice duotone. The sole character in a sea of empty seats is striking. I think this needs better cropping - too much up top for the sky and more needed on the left. There''s that dark line on the left that looks interesting but I don''t see enough of it to work out what it is.</td>', 'Nice duotone. The sole character in a sea of empty seats is striking. I think this needs better cropping - too much up top for the sky and more needed on the left. There''s that dark line on the left that looks interesting but I don''t see enough of it to work out what it is.', '2007-05-30 03:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3712872, 523410, 35352, '<td valign="top">Great idea but this needs more contrast. I like the dark up the top contrasting with the light before. That line in the bottom right corner is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Great idea but this needs more contrast. I like the dark up the top contrasting with the light before. That line in the bottom right corner is a bit distracting.', '2007-05-30 03:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
