(3712875, 523482, 35352, '<td valign="top">I think this is one of the better bible text photos. A good area is in focus with the rest slightly. The DOF is actually lifelike, not artifical looking.</td>', 'I think this is one of the better bible text photos. A good area is in focus with the rest slightly. The DOF is actually lifelike, not artifical looking.', '2007-05-30 03:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
