(3712895, 522884, 67145, '<td valign="top">man .. this is totally excellent .. i reckon you''ll get marked down coz of your processing .. ppl might say things like ''this is a photographic challenge'' .. i personally dont agree with that viewpoint .. as soon as you sharpen an image you are into the realms of digital art .. its just a matter of degree .. it is after all an advanced edit challenge ..  and of course if something is artistically pleasing then that''s an added bonus .. WHICH THIS IS!!!! .. excellent composition .. excellent idea ... just plain excellent .. =10</td>', 'man .. this is totally excellent .. i reckon you''ll get marked down coz of your processing .. ppl might say things like ''this is a photographic challenge'' .. i personally dont agree with that viewpoint .. as soon as you sharpen an image you are into the realms of digital art .. its just a matter of degree .. it is after all an advanced edit challenge ..  and of course if something is artistically pleasing then that''s an added bonus .. WHICH THIS IS!!!! .. excellent composition .. excellent idea ... just plain excellent .. =10', '2007-05-30 03:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
