(3712912, 522977, 67145, '<td valign="top">a beautiful image .. this church seems out in the middle of nowhere, which gives it a sort''v forlorn appearance .. the beauty of the surroundings just increases that feeling for me .. and i think i can see a road going off into the distance?? .. i''m imagining the road finishes at the church!! .. of course that''s probably entirely wrong .. but thats wot this is all about .. creating something in the viewer and everyone''s gonna see it differently ... i love your processing ...=9</td>', 'a beautiful image .. this church seems out in the middle of nowhere, which gives it a sort''v forlorn appearance .. the beauty of the surroundings just increases that feeling for me .. and i think i can see a road going off into the distance?? .. i''m imagining the road finishes at the church!! .. of course that''s probably entirely wrong .. but thats wot this is all about .. creating something in the viewer and everyone''s gonna see it differently ... i love your processing ...=9', '2007-05-30 03:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
