(3713259, 521635, 62787, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice shot, and the angle is good - the closed doors look scary and dominating, especially in contrast to the cute colourful kid. <br/> <br/>However, conceptually I don''t get it. Closed doors and the angle you used could be symbolic of exclusion (maybe by particular religious rules or whatever), but then the kid is an entirely random element in the picture. So it seems like you saw there was a Religion challenge, and then walked up to a church and took some shots without thinking about it too much. Which does meet the challenge, but there''s a whole sea of potential meaning that you''re then entirely missing out on.</td>', 'It''s a nice shot, and the angle is good - the closed doors look scary and dominating, especially in contrast to the cute colourful kid.  However, conceptually I don''t get it. Closed doors and the angle you used could be symbolic of exclusion (maybe by particular religious rules or whatever), but then the kid is an entirely random element in the picture. So it seems like you saw there was a Religion challenge, and then walked up to a church and took some shots without thinking about it too much. Which does meet the challenge, but there''s a whole sea of potential meaning that you''re then entirely missing out on.', '2007-05-30 08:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3713260, 522432, 76645, '<td valign="top">seems a little overexposed</td>', 'seems a little overexposed', '2007-05-30 08:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3713265, 519123, 62787, '<td valign="top">Very original image :) I like the pp you''ve done, the texture''s great, and the selective desat works well. Heh, except the noise isn''t very tranquil :p<br/> <br/>Anyway, I approve. 8</td>', 'Very original image :) I like the pp you''ve done, the texture''s great, and the selective desat works well. Heh, except the noise isn''t very tranquil :p Anyway, I approve. 8', '2007-05-30 08:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3713269, 524083, 76645, '<td valign="top">very hard to see the detail. think this might be a little over exposed</td>', 'very hard to see the detail. think this might be a little over exposed', '2007-05-30 08:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3713270, 523186, 62787, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful emotive portrait! The lighting is great, the shadows totally make the shot. And the facial expression seems genuine. <br/> <br/>Technicals: you cut off the elbow, which is a shame, and I''m not sure the black shadow in the top right serves a purpose. <br/> <br/>But yeah, good concept, well executed. Well done :)</td>', 'What a wonderful emotive portrait! The lighting is great, the shadows totally make the shot. And the facial expression seems genuine.  Technicals: you cut off the elbow, which is a shame, and I''m not sure the black shadow in the top right serves a purpose.  But yeah, good concept, well executed. Well done :)', '2007-05-30 08:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3713274, 522432, 55956, '<td valign="top">the idea is good but the photo is obliquos</td>', 'the idea is good but the photo is obliquos', '2007-05-30 08:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
