(3713290, 523960, 62787, '<td valign="top">Ok, I see the guy, and I''m struggling to make out what he''s holding. It''s a teddybear, right? <br/> <br/>I think the concept is very good, but I would''ve prefered a slightly different angle and composition. Maybe taking a picture from higher up would have worked better (looking down on someone''s darkest hour?), and I think there''s a bit too much negative space at the bottom. The highlights on the bear seem a bit burnt out, I think that''s why it''s difficult to make out at first, but it''s actually a nice touch :)</td>', 'Ok, I see the guy, and I''m struggling to make out what he''s holding. It''s a teddybear, right?  I think the concept is very good, but I would''ve prefered a slightly different angle and composition. Maybe taking a picture from higher up would have worked better (looking down on someone''s darkest hour?), and I think there''s a bit too much negative space at the bottom. The highlights on the bear seem a bit burnt out, I think that''s why it''s difficult to make out at first, but it''s actually a nice touch :)', '2007-05-30 08:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3713294, 523929, 76645, '<td valign="top">I think the frame here is a little too heavy...</td>', 'I think the frame here is a little too heavy...', '2007-05-30 08:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
