(3713322, 523859, 62787, '<td valign="top">Very pretty portrait. I like the soft light and nice deep shadows. Her expression looks quite staged though.</td>', 'Very pretty portrait. I like the soft light and nice deep shadows. Her expression looks quite staged though.', '2007-05-30 08:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
