(3713345, 520740, 62787, '<td valign="top">Boondock? Interesting concept, but not very well executed. The composition could do with improving, the lighting isn''t great, the background is distracting, and I''m not convinced B&amp;W actually works well for this shot.</td>', 'Boondock? Interesting concept, but not very well executed. The composition could do with improving, the lighting isn''t great, the background is distracting, and I''m not convinced B&W actually works well for this shot.', '2007-05-30 08:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3713350, 523427, 62787, '<td valign="top">Nice pp. The angle works extremely well, all the pointy bits of the church seem to be hinting at the potential of going heavenwards.<br/> <br/>I''m not normally a fan of obvious dodging and burning, but I have to say, it does seem to work here - makes the shot look very dramatic.</td>', 'Nice pp. The angle works extremely well, all the pointy bits of the church seem to be hinting at the potential of going heavenwards. I''m not normally a fan of obvious dodging and burning, but I have to say, it does seem to work here - makes the shot look very dramatic.', '2007-05-30 08:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3713355, 523550, 62787, '<td valign="top">Pretty cathedral, nice light. However, this shot would''ve worked much better if it was perfectly symmetrical - as far as I can tell, it needs to be rotated CCW.</td>', 'Pretty cathedral, nice light. However, this shot would''ve worked much better if it was perfectly symmetrical - as far as I can tell, it needs to be rotated CCW.', '2007-05-30 08:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3713357, 523277, 62787, '<td valign="top">Ok subject matter, but you can see traces of oversharpening, and the B&amp;W conversion doesn''t seem to be working very well here.</td>', 'Ok subject matter, but you can see traces of oversharpening, and the B&W conversion doesn''t seem to be working very well here.', '2007-05-30 08:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3713363, 522562, 62787, '<td valign="top">I like that. The colours are just right - the gentle green in the background works very well for illustrating that slightly mystical connection to nature.</td>', 'I like that. The colours are just right - the gentle green in the background works very well for illustrating that slightly mystical connection to nature.', '2007-05-30 08:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3713367, 520229, 62787, '<td valign="top">Wow. The sky is great, the light is great, and that''s some beautiful post-processing. It works very well - the sky seems to be moving fast, and the church seems to be standing up solidly in the face of that.</td>', 'Wow. The sky is great, the light is great, and that''s some beautiful post-processing. It works very well - the sky seems to be moving fast, and the church seems to be standing up solidly in the face of that.', '2007-05-30 08:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
