(3714070, 523793, 76184, '<td valign="top">Looks like a Calvin Klein advertisement...<br/>Might have been better if he were looking at her...just an idea...</td>', 'Looks like a Calvin Klein advertisement...Might have been better if he were looking at her...just an idea...', '2007-05-30 11:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3714080, 523566, 76184, '<td valign="top">I don''t much get the idea of "religion" here, but this is a damned powerful image. If I could give it a 20, I would, but you''ll just have to make due with a 10.</td>', 'I don''t much get the idea of "religion" here, but this is a damned powerful image. If I could give it a 20, I would, but you''ll just have to make due with a 10.', '2007-05-30 11:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3714097, 519414, 76184, '<td valign="top">unimaginative, and expected.<br/>It doesn''t seem that much thought went into this image.</td>', 'unimaginative, and expected.It doesn''t seem that much thought went into this image.', '2007-05-30 11:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3714103, 520098, 76184, '<td valign="top">I like the image...I wish there were more contrast, though.</td>', 'I like the image...I wish there were more contrast, though.', '2007-05-30 11:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3714114, 523762, 76184, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty noisy shot. Turn down your ISO next time, and use a longer exposure. There is a lot of detail to be had in the tree line to the right of the church. More separation between the trees and sky would have made this image more pleasing. This is a good idea, and a good start, it just needs refinement.</td>', 'This is a pretty noisy shot. Turn down your ISO next time, and use a longer exposure. There is a lot of detail to be had in the tree line to the right of the church. More separation between the trees and sky would have made this image more pleasing. This is a good idea, and a good start, it just needs refinement.', '2007-05-30 11:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3714142, 522839, 62787, '<td valign="top">I love all the parallel lines, and the noise really adds to the mood of the picture. It''s almost painting-like. 7</td>', 'I love all the parallel lines, and the noise really adds to the mood of the picture. It''s almost painting-like. 7', '2007-05-30 11:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3714151, 523236, 62787, '<td valign="top">The shadow of the cross looks amazing. I think you could''ve emphasised it even more in post processing, it''s a bit hard to spot at first.</td>', 'The shadow of the cross looks amazing. I think you could''ve emphasised it even more in post processing, it''s a bit hard to spot at first.', '2007-05-30 12:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3714159, 524080, 62787, '<td valign="top">Such a bad argument. And depressingly still often put forward seriously.  8</td>', 'Such a bad argument. And depressingly still often put forward seriously.  8', '2007-05-30 12:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3714160, 519799, 62787, '<td valign="top">The background is distracting, and a different angle would have been better.</td>', 'The background is distracting, and a different angle would have been better.', '2007-05-30 12:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3714165, 523915, 18197, '<td valign="top">Powerful image! It''s well executed and well processed. B&amp;W was a great choice. But its strongest feature is its composition. Composition of the hands is terrific. Triangle formed by the head and point of the spike and the hammer reinforces the triangle formed by the hands. The overlapping triangles swing your eye round and round the frame.</td>', 'Powerful image! It''s well executed and well processed. B&W was a great choice. But its strongest feature is its composition. Composition of the hands is terrific. Triangle formed by the head and point of the spike and the hammer reinforces the triangle formed by the hands. The overlapping triangles swing your eye round and round the frame.', '2007-05-30 12:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3714166, 523864, 62787, '<td valign="top">Extra points for picking an obscure deity :)<br/> <br/>I would''ve preferred it if you''d rotated the picture CCW slightly - this way I feel a bit like I''m on a boat whenever I look at it. Very good image though! 8</td>', 'Extra points for picking an obscure deity :) I would''ve preferred it if you''d rotated the picture CCW slightly - this way I feel a bit like I''m on a boat whenever I look at it. Very good image though! 8', '2007-05-30 12:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3714170, 521041, 62787, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but the green just doesn''t do it for me.</td>', 'Nice image, but the green just doesn''t do it for me.', '2007-05-30 12:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3714173, 519110, 61552, '<td valign="top">How??</td>', 'How??', '2007-05-30 12:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
