(3714199, 522884, 18197, '<td valign="top">Love the concept. Colors are great. Setting is fine. In short a good photo. But the processing is too much for my taste, less would have been more for me.</td>', 'Love the concept. Colors are great. Setting is fine. In short a good photo. But the processing is too much for my taste, less would have been more for me.', '2007-05-30 12:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
