(3714940, 520476, 47316, '<td valign="top">I think the dirt on the face took this too far. There is really no reason or explanation for it. As far as the image, I think this is a great improvement on some of your past close ups. The light is nice and the colorful bokeh is a nice touch. I like that you backed it out more instead of having the crop right in your face. The editing seems simple and I like that too.</td>', 'I think the dirt on the face took this too far. There is really no reason or explanation for it. As far as the image, I think this is a great improvement on some of your past close ups. The light is nice and the colorful bokeh is a nice touch. I like that you backed it out more instead of having the crop right in your face. The editing seems simple and I like that too.', '2007-05-30 14:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
