(3718403, 519082, 76430, '<td valign="top">This has the makings of a nice picture, but it''s not very sharp and would be better if you had more of the two guys in front visible.  Maybe turning the camera sideways would accomplish that as well as removing some of the construction on the left.  If I''m not mistaken I believe the horizon is off a bit.</td>', 'This has the makings of a nice picture, but it''s not very sharp and would be better if you had more of the two guys in front visible.  Maybe turning the camera sideways would accomplish that as well as removing some of the construction on the left.  If I''m not mistaken I believe the horizon is off a bit.', '2007-05-31 03:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3718414, 523312, 60195, '<td valign="top">There''s just something about this shot.  Great overall feel.  Love the use of DoF. Points for making me look again (and again).  Bump to an 8. Well done :O)</td>', 'There''s just something about this shot.  Great overall feel.  Love the use of DoF. Points for making me look again (and again).  Bump to an 8. Well done :O)', '2007-05-31 04:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
