(3718421, 524109, 74209, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the scripture quote.  Well chosen, given the lighting. He was crucified in the evening, and this could have been precisely the view as the 3-hour darkness lifted.  I hope you get the blue for this.  You deserve it for your hard work.  Only one flaw above the heel on the post - should be cloned to remove the post-like impression.  Otherwise intense, dramatic image.  Thank you!</td>', 'I appreciate the scripture quote.  Well chosen, given the lighting. He was crucified in the evening, and this could have been precisely the view as the 3-hour darkness lifted.  I hope you get the blue for this.  You deserve it for your hard work.  Only one flaw above the heel on the post - should be cloned to remove the post-like impression.  Otherwise intense, dramatic image.  Thank you!', '2007-05-31 04:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
