(3718929, 519119, 76430, '<td valign="top">I like it, but can barely see the shoes, since the picture is so small and there is too much road in front.  Use the 640 pixels God gave you.</td>', 'I like it, but can barely see the shoes, since the picture is so small and there is too much road in front.  Use the 640 pixels God gave you.', '2007-05-31 11:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3718953, 519818, 76430, '<td valign="top">I like the picture overall.  Very good lighting.  It''s one of those illusion type pictures.  At first I thought it was a woman with a shawl turned around with her left elbow up and right hand on the table, and facing the shadow on the wall that is probably saying "Ave Maria".  Closer examination shows it to be a ballet dancer with her head cut off.  I''m wondering the purpose of the cut-off head.  Maybe it''s to disguise the figure as possibly being Mary?</td>', 'I like the picture overall.  Very good lighting.  It''s one of those illusion type pictures.  At first I thought it was a woman with a shawl turned around with her left elbow up and right hand on the table, and facing the shadow on the wall that is probably saying "Ave Maria".  Closer examination shows it to be a ballet dancer with her head cut off.  I''m wondering the purpose of the cut-off head.  Maybe it''s to disguise the figure as possibly being Mary?', '2007-05-31 11:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
