(3719475, 523487, 2337, '<td valign="top">Very strong image. Well done...  My only nitpick is the horizon seems slightly sloped to the left.  Not sure if it''s illusion or actually sloped, but the "piller" also looks a tad it skewed.  Excellent shot!</td>', 'Very strong image. Well done...  My only nitpick is the horizon seems slightly sloped to the left.  Not sure if it''s illusion or actually sloped, but the "piller" also looks a tad it skewed.  Excellent shot!', '2007-05-31 14:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
