(3719500, 523180, 2337, '<td valign="top">Pulling the car forward to hide the grass on the left would have made a much stronger image to my eye.  Also the ''balance'' is thrown off by the closer crop on the left.  Either pull back to include the space next to the turn signal on the left or come closer to exclude that space on the right.  Nice effort, interesting slant on the challange.</td>', 'Pulling the car forward to hide the grass on the left would have made a much stronger image to my eye.  Also the ''balance'' is thrown off by the closer crop on the left.  Either pull back to include the space next to the turn signal on the left or come closer to exclude that space on the right.  Nice effort, interesting slant on the challange.', '2007-05-31 14:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719510, 524134, 67152, '<td valign="top">Not a bad image, but taking a photo of a piece of artwork without making it somehow your own (placing your own context to it) is not really what I think challenges are about.</td>', 'Not a bad image, but taking a photo of a piece of artwork without making it somehow your own (placing your own context to it) is not really what I think challenges are about.', '2007-05-31 14:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719511, 524104, 2337, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but not exceptionally so.  It''s a long stretch to fit the challange</td>', 'Nice shot, but not exceptionally so.  It''s a long stretch to fit the challange', '2007-05-31 14:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719512, 524084, 78062, '<td valign="top">a nice pic but  a little... erm... overdone? I cant think of the word but im trying to be polite and I think ive seen this pic in various guises many times before.<br/> <br/>Having said that, the levels adjustment is perfect as you can see every slate on that roof. I would have made the JESUS bit lighter though on the right or maybe taken the shot from there looking at the roof or something.</td>', 'a nice pic but  a little... erm... overdone? I cant think of the word but im trying to be polite and I think ive seen this pic in various guises many times before. Having said that, the levels adjustment is perfect as you can see every slate on that roof. I would have made the JESUS bit lighter though on the right or maybe taken the shot from there looking at the roof or something.', '2007-05-31 14:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719516, 523550, 78062, '<td valign="top">Not bad... reminds me of my salisbury one called Pillars of Faith. <br/> <br/>Needs to be straightened, possibly sharpened and maybe a border would help?</td>', 'Not bad... reminds me of my salisbury one called Pillars of Faith.  Needs to be straightened, possibly sharpened and maybe a border would help?', '2007-05-31 14:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719517, 523864, 78062, '<td valign="top">Looks like a video game box. Good job.</td>', 'Looks like a video game box. Good job.', '2007-05-31 14:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719523, 522883, 78062, '<td valign="top">I have one of these statues that was a wedding present... I cant see what it has to do with religion though. Is that guy God? Is god love? Love is God? Are these 2 wooden people? <br/> <br/>A good picture for a centrally focussed one.</td>', 'I have one of these statues that was a wedding present... I cant see what it has to do with religion though. Is that guy God? Is god love? Love is God? Are these 2 wooden people?  A good picture for a centrally focussed one.', '2007-05-31 15:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719524, 522649, 78062, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF.</td>', 'Nice DOF.', '2007-05-31 15:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719526, 523707, 78062, '<td valign="top">Arrrr... You used a flash right? You can see the rebound a mile away and it all looks a bit washed out. This wouldve been superb if it was darker around the edges and with this being advanced editing I cant see why you didnt do that.</td>', 'Arrrr... You used a flash right? You can see the rebound a mile away and it all looks a bit washed out. This wouldve been superb if it was darker around the edges and with this being advanced editing I cant see why you didnt do that.', '2007-05-31 15:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719528, 524184, 78062, '<td valign="top">Clever. HAd to look for what the hell you were talking about, which I like.</td>', 'Clever. HAd to look for what the hell you were talking about, which I like.', '2007-05-31 15:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719530, 522693, 78062, '<td valign="top">Interesting quote and a nice picture but i''m not sure this is to do with religion... it''s a leaf. |Then again, if your a druid, I take that back,</td>', 'Interesting quote and a nice picture but i''m not sure this is to do with religion... it''s a leaf. |Then again, if your a druid, I take that back,', '2007-05-31 15:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719533, 519550, 78062, '<td valign="top">Shame the face isnt lighter.</td>', 'Shame the face isnt lighter.', '2007-05-31 15:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719534, 523904, 2337, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot.  I''d be curious to know if you tried a shot from a higher angle where there''d be more of the repetition of candletop "circles" and less of the dark?  I''d love to see it if you try''d that.</td>', 'Very interesting shot.  I''d be curious to know if you tried a shot from a higher angle where there''d be more of the repetition of candletop "circles" and less of the dark?  I''d love to see it if you try''d that.', '2007-05-31 15:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719536, 523613, 78062, '<td valign="top">This could have been so much more interesting I think. Maybe a viewpoint right behind the person with the rock looming over them.</td>', 'This could have been so much more interesting I think. Maybe a viewpoint right behind the person with the rock looming over them.', '2007-05-31 15:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719538, 523611, 67152, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and textures - that one awesome background for this Buddah!</td>', 'Love the colors and textures - that one awesome background for this Buddah!', '2007-05-31 15:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719541, 523551, 78062, '<td valign="top">LOvely lighting, looks like a catalogue shot.</td>', 'LOvely lighting, looks like a catalogue shot.', '2007-05-31 15:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719544, 523664, 78062, '<td valign="top">Shame its a touch our of focus.</td>', 'Shame its a touch our of focus.', '2007-05-31 15:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
