(3719558, 522563, 78062, '<td valign="top">The best one i''ve seen so far. No cheesy portraits, no flowers on a grave. I just wish the guy was doing something more interesting. Great shot though.</td>', 'The best one i''ve seen so far. No cheesy portraits, no flowers on a grave. I just wish the guy was doing something more interesting. Great shot though.', '2007-05-31 15:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719559, 523421, 78062, '<td valign="top">Clever shot. I didnt get the africa connection at first, then i took my moron hat off and now I see. I like.</td>', 'Clever shot. I didnt get the africa connection at first, then i took my moron hat off and now I see. I like.', '2007-05-31 15:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719561, 523428, 78062, '<td valign="top">Come as you are.</td>', 'Come as you are.', '2007-05-31 15:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719563, 523610, 78062, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, i would have gone for a different title.. maybe "the ugly side of religion" or something equally trite.</td>', 'Nice shot, i would have gone for a different title.. maybe "the ugly side of religion" or something equally trite.', '2007-05-31 15:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719567, 520496, 78062, '<td valign="top">Needs blood on the nail to convince me. Otherwise a great shot.</td>', 'Needs blood on the nail to convince me. Otherwise a great shot.', '2007-05-31 15:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719570, 524057, 78062, '<td valign="top">A black border would be sweet here.</td>', 'A black border would be sweet here.', '2007-05-31 15:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719574, 523477, 78062, '<td valign="top">Shame the background is so distracting.</td>', 'Shame the background is so distracting.', '2007-05-31 15:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719658, 519082, 67152, '<td valign="top">I like the angle and the color and the activity around the Mosque - but would have liked it a little more in focus.</td>', 'I like the angle and the color and the activity around the Mosque - but would have liked it a little more in focus.', '2007-05-31 15:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719661, 521458, 67152, '<td valign="top">Pretty flowers and colors but the lighting on this one is off - seems very underexposed - the whites are not white.</td>', 'Pretty flowers and colors but the lighting on this one is off - seems very underexposed - the whites are not white.', '2007-05-31 15:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719663, 521458, 78062, '<td valign="top">Looks a little washed out and I''m not sure what this has to do with religion...</td>', 'Looks a little washed out and I''m not sure what this has to do with religion...', '2007-05-31 15:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719669, 522840, 67152, '<td valign="top">Excellent close up of the Holy Mysteries - love the details int he hands an the reflections in the chalice and the deep colors.  Very nice work.</td>', 'Excellent close up of the Holy Mysteries - love the details int he hands an the reflections in the chalice and the deep colors.  Very nice work.', '2007-05-31 15:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719682, 520098, 67152, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice set up of this - but the lighting seems a little off - not enough contrast and the image doesn''t come across as very sharp</td>', 'Pretty nice set up of this - but the lighting seems a little off - not enough contrast and the image doesn''t come across as very sharp', '2007-05-31 15:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719693, 523425, 78062, '<td valign="top">Looks just like another picture in this challenge.</td>', 'Looks just like another picture in this challenge.', '2007-05-31 15:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719696, 523768, 78062, '<td valign="top">Nice but I wouldve liked the guys to be a bit further in the distance to give it more impact.</td>', 'Nice but I wouldve liked the guys to be a bit further in the distance to give it more impact.', '2007-05-31 15:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719722, 523997, 67152, '<td valign="top">I love the light on the church and the pose and placement - but I got to say that the choice of the dress for the man - the sweater just seems a little odd - a solid color (less happy) might make this a little more dramatic.  Still, it gets a 7 for well done.</td>', 'I love the light on the church and the pose and placement - but I got to say that the choice of the dress for the man - the sweater just seems a little odd - a solid color (less happy) might make this a little more dramatic.  Still, it gets a 7 for well done.', '2007-05-31 15:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719728, 523523, 48227, '<td valign="top">Excellent. 10</td>', 'Excellent. 10', '2007-05-31 15:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719827, 524162, 67145, '<td valign="top">stunning imgage ... i love those beautiful reflections and the detail on the lantern at the front .. =8</td>', 'stunning imgage ... i love those beautiful reflections and the detail on the lantern at the front .. =8', '2007-05-31 16:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719832, 521726, 2337, '<td valign="top">Nice slant on the challenge, and well shot as well :)  I might have saturated the blue a bit more, but I can''t say that would have been an improvement...  My one Nitpick is the title.  It''s kind of long and cumbersome.  Certainly it won''t effect my vote. I vote on the image, not the title... But I wanted you to know it was a distraction...</td>', 'Nice slant on the challenge, and well shot as well :)  I might have saturated the blue a bit more, but I can''t say that would have been an improvement...  My one Nitpick is the title.  It''s kind of long and cumbersome.  Certainly it won''t effect my vote. I vote on the image, not the title... But I wanted you to know it was a distraction...', '2007-05-31 16:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719839, 523550, 2337, '<td valign="top">Nice range of tones :)  and your angle certainly makes use of the architects focus lines.  Well shot.</td>', 'Nice range of tones :)  and your angle certainly makes use of the architects focus lines.  Well shot.', '2007-05-31 16:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719843, 523312, 67145, '<td valign="top">i found this image excellent just on the visual impact, but i didnt know wot mea culpa meant, so i googled it .. ''my own fault'' .. so from an initial vote of 8 i''m changing it to a 10, coz not only is this an excellent image but it has real meaning as well ... =10</td>', 'i found this image excellent just on the visual impact, but i didnt know wot mea culpa meant, so i googled it .. ''my own fault'' .. so from an initial vote of 8 i''m changing it to a 10, coz not only is this an excellent image but it has real meaning as well ... =10', '2007-05-31 16:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719849, 523638, 67145, '<td valign="top">stunning image .. the crosses so stark against that amazing sky ... the beauty of this photograph makes me feel that not only is it finished, but ''its'' begun as well, showing promise and hope ... =9</td>', 'stunning image .. the crosses so stark against that amazing sky ... the beauty of this photograph makes me feel that not only is it finished, but ''its'' begun as well, showing promise and hope ... =9', '2007-05-31 16:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719854, 523756, 2337, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big fan of abstract, but this is well done and quite interesting.  I don''t see the relationship to the challange, but that''s likely cause I''m not a fan of abstract :)</td>', 'I''m not a big fan of abstract, but this is well done and quite interesting.  I don''t see the relationship to the challange, but that''s likely cause I''m not a fan of abstract :)', '2007-05-31 16:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719876, 523997, 67145, '<td valign="top">poignant .. i love the composition with that expanse of dark blue/grey sky and the church dwarfed by it .. the closed gate is another excellent element that gives strength to your message .. the positioning of the person with his back to the church shows me that altho the person is looking, he may be looking in the the wrong place, which of course is a very common ''problem''!!!! ... the sunlight so bright on the church is like a ''look at me'' .. if only he''d turn around he may find his god ... of course he may have turned his back intentionally on that particular god and be looking for god somewhere else, but still not finding him ... so many messages in this wonderful image ... =10</td>', 'poignant .. i love the composition with that expanse of dark blue/grey sky and the church dwarfed by it .. the closed gate is another excellent element that gives strength to your message .. the positioning of the person with his back to the church shows me that altho the person is looking, he may be looking in the the wrong place, which of course is a very common ''problem''!!!! ... the sunlight so bright on the church is like a ''look at me'' .. if only he''d turn around he may find his god ... of course he may have turned his back intentionally on that particular god and be looking for god somewhere else, but still not finding him ... so many messages in this wonderful image ... =10', '2007-05-31 16:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719878, 522762, 2337, '<td valign="top">Met the challenge.  Hand on the right a tad overexposed and not sure what''s going on in the upper left, but it''s distracting.</td>', 'Met the challenge.  Hand on the right a tad overexposed and not sure what''s going on in the upper left, but it''s distracting.', '2007-05-31 16:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719890, 523738, 2337, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The cars and trucks are certainly a distraction, but one you would have been hard pressed to avoid.  I love the foreground tree.  For me it makes the shot.</td>', 'Very nice.  The cars and trucks are certainly a distraction, but one you would have been hard pressed to avoid.  I love the foreground tree.  For me it makes the shot.', '2007-05-31 16:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719902, 522389, 2337, '<td valign="top">Beutiful building and well shot!  Interesting sky.  I would be interested in how many different times of day you went there and the results of other times.  I might have liked to see how this would look without the building being "dead center" in the frame.  The white area in lower right was distracting though I have no way of knowing if it could have been avoided.</td>', 'Beutiful building and well shot!  Interesting sky.  I would be interested in how many different times of day you went there and the results of other times.  I might have liked to see how this would look without the building being "dead center" in the frame.  The white area in lower right was distracting though I have no way of knowing if it could have been avoided.', '2007-05-31 16:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719911, 522384, 61552, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but huh?  I don''t correlate this to religion.</td>', 'Nice picture, but huh?  I don''t correlate this to religion.', '2007-05-31 16:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719918, 522674, 2337, '<td valign="top">Well framed, excellent lighting...  Love the tonal range! Can''t even find anything to nitpick... Congrads on a fantastiv image!</td>', 'Well framed, excellent lighting...  Love the tonal range! Can''t even find anything to nitpick... Congrads on a fantastiv image!', '2007-05-31 16:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719919, 523396, 61552, '<td valign="top">That''s good, but she''s waaaayyyyy to old for the priest!  7</td>', 'That''s good, but she''s waaaayyyyy to old for the priest!  7', '2007-05-31 16:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719920, 523955, 67145, '<td valign="top">a powerful message and one that we should all listen to!</td>', 'a powerful message and one that we should all listen to!', '2007-05-31 16:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719924, 521582, 67145, '<td valign="top">stunning .. a beautiful portrayal ... =9</td>', 'stunning .. a beautiful portrayal ... =9', '2007-05-31 16:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719925, 519911, 2337, '<td valign="top">Very intersting subject!  A bit too bright for my taste...  Not sure what was lower on this statue, but I can''t help feeling it would have been more interesting that the top 2/5ths of this shot.  I could be wrong of course :)</td>', 'Very intersting subject!  A bit too bright for my taste...  Not sure what was lower on this statue, but I can''t help feeling it would have been more interesting that the top 2/5ths of this shot.  I could be wrong of course :)', '2007-05-31 16:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719958, 523796, 2337, '<td valign="top">Excellent image...  One nitpick, the title took away from it.  I think a far more simple title of "James 1:27" would have been MUCH more invoking.  Anyone moved by sentiment or curiosity would have known where to look for the rest.  The greatest impact can be from what is left unsaid.</td>', 'Excellent image...  One nitpick, the title took away from it.  I think a far more simple title of "James 1:27" would have been MUCH more invoking.  Anyone moved by sentiment or curiosity would have known where to look for the rest.  The greatest impact can be from what is left unsaid.', '2007-05-31 16:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719960, 522977, 2337, '<td valign="top">Stunning...  I look forward to seeing what lens/settings you used.</td>', 'Stunning...  I look forward to seeing what lens/settings you used.', '2007-05-31 16:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719964, 523540, 2337, '<td valign="top">Well done!</td>', 'Well done!', '2007-05-31 16:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719971, 522979, 2337, '<td valign="top">There are some lighting and focus issues here...  Hard shot to get just right.</td>', 'There are some lighting and focus issues here...  Hard shot to get just right.', '2007-05-31 16:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719978, 524050, 2337, '<td valign="top">wow</td>', 'wow', '2007-05-31 16:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3720000, 522597, 67145, '<td valign="top">stunning image ..</td>', 'stunning image ..', '2007-05-31 17:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3720004, 519818, 67145, '<td valign="top">incredible image ... so well thought out, so incredibly executed and the processing is excellent .. definitely a first page, possibly a ribbon .. =10</td>', 'incredible image ... so well thought out, so incredibly executed and the processing is excellent .. definitely a first page, possibly a ribbon .. =10', '2007-05-31 17:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3720005, 521124, 2337, '<td valign="top">Small stretch to fit the challenge, but I can see it :)  The sky is kind of blown out.  Could have been spectacular with some texture (or even blue) in the sky :)</td>', 'Small stretch to fit the challenge, but I can see it :)  The sky is kind of blown out.  Could have been spectacular with some texture (or even blue) in the sky :)', '2007-05-31 17:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3720016, 523780, 2337, '<td valign="top">I like how the sculpture on the podium, the paining in the background and the people in between all kind of mirror eachother.  Don''t know if that was intended, But I like it :)  Interesting lighting too.</td>', 'I like how the sculpture on the podium, the paining in the background and the people in between all kind of mirror eachother.  Don''t know if that was intended, But I like it :)  Interesting lighting too.', '2007-05-31 17:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3720024, 519476, 2337, '<td valign="top">Huge stretch to make this fit the challenge. Even with the title.  There are also some lighting issues.</td>', 'Huge stretch to make this fit the challenge. Even with the title.  There are also some lighting issues.', '2007-05-31 17:21:51.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3720026, 523455, 67145, '<td valign="top">just excellent .. i love the way the body''s lying on the road and the posture of the ''spirit''   .. excellent idea and love your processing .. i had a similar idea, and did my first long exposure for the religion challenge .. i called it ''a soul''s journey'' .. mine was the soul coming out''v the body and reaching up, to show yearning for the spiritual .. unfortunately too much use of vignette and curves, plus increasing the canvas size got me a dq .. i''m happy, coz it was bombing out real bad, and now i''m just more aware of wot i can and cant do in an advanced challenge .. also if i''m at all unsure, and i have time, i''ll ask for validation before the challenge starts voting .. i hope you do well in this coz it is a wonderful image .... :) =9</td>', 'just excellent .. i love the way the body''s lying on the road and the posture of the ''spirit''   .. excellent idea and love your processing .. i had a similar idea, and did my first long exposure for the religion challenge .. i called it ''a soul''s journey'' .. mine was the soul coming out''v the body and reaching up, to show yearning for the spiritual .. unfortunately too much use of vignette and curves, plus increasing the canvas size got me a dq .. i''m happy, coz it was bombing out real bad, and now i''m just more aware of wot i can and cant do in an advanced challenge .. also if i''m at all unsure, and i have time, i''ll ask for validation before the challenge starts voting .. i hope you do well in this coz it is a wonderful image .... :) =9', '2007-05-31 17:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3720032, 523906, 2337, '<td valign="top">Very interested to see the lens/settings you used.  Was this mostly post processing or was this largely done "in-camera"?  Either way, STUNNING shot!</td>', 'Very interested to see the lens/settings you used.  Was this mostly post processing or was this largely done "in-camera"?  Either way, STUNNING shot!', '2007-05-31 17:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3720035, 520468, 2337, '<td valign="top">Interesting phote, well lit, etc... But, ummm...  Pretty tough stretch for the challenge</td>', 'Interesting phote, well lit, etc... But, ummm...  Pretty tough stretch for the challenge', '2007-05-31 17:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3720038, 523551, 67145, '<td valign="top">stunning image ... love your composition, the contrasts and the lighting ..</td>', 'stunning image ... love your composition, the contrasts and the lighting ..', '2007-05-31 17:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3720049, 523959, 2337, '<td valign="top">Powerful image.  I think it could have benefitted from a stronger use of the rule of thirds... But that''s just me.</td>', 'Powerful image.  I think it could have benefitted from a stronger use of the rule of thirds... But that''s just me.', '2007-05-31 17:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3720056, 524109, 2337, '<td valign="top">Powerful!  Strong diagonal line and nice use of rule of thirds!</td>', 'Powerful!  Strong diagonal line and nice use of rule of thirds!', '2007-05-31 17:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3720061, 524141, 2337, '<td valign="top">The black at the top adds little.  Could you have reframed this to exclude the ceiling and maybe have candles to the top?  Just my opinion :)</td>', 'The black at the top adds little.  Could you have reframed this to exclude the ceiling and maybe have candles to the top?  Just my opinion :)', '2007-05-31 17:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3720067, 524043, 2337, '<td valign="top">Requires the title to meet the challenge... But I see where you''re coming from with it...  The forearms and upper thumb are a bit burned out</td>', 'Requires the title to meet the challenge... But I see where you''re coming from with it...  The forearms and upper thumb are a bit burned out', '2007-05-31 17:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3720069, 522714, 2337, '<td valign="top">The red lines make this...  Well done</td>', 'The red lines make this...  Well done', '2007-05-31 17:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3720077, 519417, 2337, '<td valign="top">lighting issues...  Also perspective issues...</td>', 'lighting issues...  Also perspective issues...', '2007-05-31 17:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
