(3720324, 522979, 78388, '<td valign="top">=)<br/> <br/>I eventually put an entry in science, but before this is I was contemplating something very similar - drawing a pentagram in long exposure over stone with Richard Dawkin''s excellent "God Delusion" in the centre.<br/> <br/>Based on your title, mine would have to have simply been called "Good"!<br/> <br/>Nice shot - I think the bible could have been better centered in the pentagram though.</td>', '=) I eventually put an entry in science, but before this is I was contemplating something very similar - drawing a pentagram in long exposure over stone with Richard Dawkin''s excellent "God Delusion" in the centre. Based on your title, mine would have to have simply been called "Good"! Nice shot - I think the bible could have been better centered in the pentagram though.', '2007-05-31 18:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
