(3720390, 521072, 2337, '<td valign="top">The title is WAY too distracting.  Less is more...  I like the lighting, but the focus is soft on key words...  While words in the foreground were sharp, "world, that He" is soft... and "It is a Fact That God Loves You" is even softer focused.  But most of all, the title killed this image for me...  Great as a sermon, horrid as a title...</td>', 'The title is WAY too distracting.  Less is more...  I like the lighting, but the focus is soft on key words...  While words in the foreground were sharp, "world, that He" is soft... and "It is a Fact That God Loves You" is even softer focused.  But most of all, the title killed this image for me...  Great as a sermon, horrid as a title...', '2007-05-31 19:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
