(3721152, 523519, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very neat capture and interesting viewing angle which gives the church that hollywood cut-out look. Of course, the image gains in momentum with the walking holy figure, the divine foreground and background. Love it. Bump.</td>', 'Very neat capture and interesting viewing angle which gives the church that hollywood cut-out look. Of course, the image gains in momentum with the walking holy figure, the divine foreground and background. Love it. Bump.', '2007-05-31 23:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3721157, 521194, 22734, '<td valign="top">Graphically convincing! Bump.</td>', 'Graphically convincing! Bump.', '2007-05-31 23:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3721161, 520496, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very well presented. Bump.</td>', 'Very well presented. Bump.', '2007-05-31 23:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3721164, 522858, 77196, '<td valign="top">Too dark.</td>', 'Too dark.', '2007-05-31 23:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3721166, 523396, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very nice to find this oasis of comical release in such a serious challenge. Funny and very well illustrated. Bump.</td>', 'Very nice to find this oasis of comical release in such a serious challenge. Funny and very well illustrated. Bump.', '2007-05-31 23:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3721168, 523236, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not sure the shadow of the cross shows up well enough in this size. The foreground is too dark. This is one of those situations where a camera will just not capture the experience. The photo does, however, capture enough to remind you of it - which may be the most valuable of all.</td>', 'Not sure the shadow of the cross shows up well enough in this size. The foreground is too dark. This is one of those situations where a camera will just not capture the experience. The photo does, however, capture enough to remind you of it - which may be the most valuable of all.', '2007-05-31 23:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3721170, 523102, 22734, '<td valign="top">Interesting and penetrating image. Bump.</td>', 'Interesting and penetrating image. Bump.', '2007-05-31 23:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3721181, 519422, 22734, '<td valign="top">Highly interesting because it reaches out further in its statement and then such a wonderful presentation. Bump. After considering all entries this one appeals more to me because it stands as a generic spiritual entry. That is, it is not associated with the conventional religions. Worthy of the Blue or at least red or yellow.</td>', 'Highly interesting because it reaches out further in its statement and then such a wonderful presentation. Bump. After considering all entries this one appeals more to me because it stands as a generic spiritual entry. That is, it is not associated with the conventional religions. Worthy of the Blue or at least red or yellow.', '2007-05-31 23:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3721182, 523356, 77196, '<td valign="top">Don''t choose difficult subjects, do you? The hallway is too dark, and the outside is blown out (overexposed). The primary focus becomes the hallway floor, which is featureless except shadows from the arches, etc.</td>', 'Don''t choose difficult subjects, do you? The hallway is too dark, and the outside is blown out (overexposed). The primary focus becomes the hallway floor, which is featureless except shadows from the arches, etc.', '2007-05-31 23:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3721236, 523955, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the open mouth. The stone on his necklace is a primary focal area of the picture, but is out of focus, which I find distracting. Nice, crisp focus on face &amp; I like the contrast of lighting. If he wants to be less "Misunderstood", he would do well to learn the meaning in western culture of "Silence is consent".</td>', 'Not sure I like the open mouth. The stone on his necklace is a primary focal area of the picture, but is out of focus, which I find distracting. Nice, crisp focus on face & I like the contrast of lighting. If he wants to be less "Misunderstood", he would do well to learn the meaning in western culture of "Silence is consent".', '2007-05-31 23:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3721243, 519119, 77196, '<td valign="top">Too small. Foreground is overexposed. At this size, you can''t really see the Nikes...</td>', 'Too small. Foreground is overexposed. At this size, you can''t really see the Nikes...', '2007-05-31 23:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
