(3723703, 520468, 36006, '<td valign="top">sorry, but as a photographer your job is to convince me.<br/> <br/>photographically, this is a nice picture. However, I am not convinced that this is religious.</td>', 'sorry, but as a photographer your job is to convince me. photographically, this is a nice picture. However, I am not convinced that this is religious.', '2007-06-01 11:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723729, 522413, 68256, '<td valign="top">I like the "busyness" with this...somewhow it works.  The saturation is a little overboard for a religion shot for my taste, but that is just a personal oppinion.  I would have prefered a more subtle saturation.  Of course that may be what you were actually trying to portriat..7</td>', 'I like the "busyness" with this...somewhow it works.  The saturation is a little overboard for a religion shot for my taste, but that is just a personal oppinion.  I would have prefered a more subtle saturation.  Of course that may be what you were actually trying to portriat..7', '2007-06-01 11:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723755, 523929, 68256, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait and I like the large border for this one.  Perhaps it is a little soft in the eyes so the large border helps (by reducing the size of the portrait), but overall sharpness is fine.  7</td>', 'Nice portrait and I like the large border for this one.  Perhaps it is a little soft in the eyes so the large border helps (by reducing the size of the portrait), but overall sharpness is fine.  7', '2007-06-01 11:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723766, 520957, 68256, '<td valign="top">The composition doesn''t really seem interesting to me in this.  I like your processing and muted tones though.  I have a feeling your getting multiple comments on the size being 420 instead of 640...<br/> <br/>The lighting is a bit harsh so the shadows have lost all detail (at least on my monitor).  5</td>', 'The composition doesn''t really seem interesting to me in this.  I like your processing and muted tones though.  I have a feeling your getting multiple comments on the size being 420 instead of 640... The lighting is a bit harsh so the shadows have lost all detail (at least on my monitor).  5', '2007-06-01 12:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723789, 523521, 68256, '<td valign="top">The cool higlights (and I mean color wise not "hip") are kinda strange in relation to the warm tones of her skin and the hair on her left side.  It makes for an unblanced composition in my opinion.  Since I''m Christian I have no idea what the moon goddess is supposed to portrait, but her pose suggests serenity and the colors suggest tension..kinda makes me confused.  <br/> <br/>6</td>', 'The cool higlights (and I mean color wise not "hip") are kinda strange in relation to the warm tones of her skin and the hair on her left side.  It makes for an unblanced composition in my opinion.  Since I''m Christian I have no idea what the moon goddess is supposed to portrait, but her pose suggests serenity and the colors suggest tension..kinda makes me confused.   6', '2007-06-01 12:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723793, 523668, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very interesting use of motion blur, but I fail to see the reason for it.  I''m sure that is just my lack of vision.  The treatment seems contridictory to the Cross.  As pure art I like it and it certainly is an interesting photo to look at.  6</td>', 'Very interesting use of motion blur, but I fail to see the reason for it.  I''m sure that is just my lack of vision.  The treatment seems contridictory to the Cross.  As pure art I like it and it certainly is an interesting photo to look at.  6', '2007-06-01 12:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723813, 524033, 68256, '<td valign="top">I like the filtered lighting on the Freckled Angel which has great modeling, but the background is so distracting.  The blown out higlights and limbs going everywere make it hard for the eyes to stay planted on the subject....I like your choice of saturation level very much as the muted tones work great.  A shallower DOF (smaller f number) would have blurred the background and provided a little more separation for the Angel.  You probably already know that and were limited by equipment but I thought I say it anyway.</td>', 'I like the filtered lighting on the Freckled Angel which has great modeling, but the background is so distracting.  The blown out higlights and limbs going everywere make it hard for the eyes to stay planted on the subject....I like your choice of saturation level very much as the muted tones work great.  A shallower DOF (smaller f number) would have blurred the background and provided a little more separation for the Angel.  You probably already know that and were limited by equipment but I thought I say it anyway.', '2007-06-01 12:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723828, 519188, 68256, '<td valign="top">I love the subtle highlight around the cross but I wished it was cropped tighter.  I think if you could have cropped out the trees on either side and the white blob down low it would have been more powerful.  The highlight around the cross really draws the eyes in though to that really makes this shot nice.  8</td>', 'I love the subtle highlight around the cross but I wished it was cropped tighter.  I think if you could have cropped out the trees on either side and the white blob down low it would have been more powerful.  The highlight around the cross really draws the eyes in though to that really makes this shot nice.  8', '2007-06-01 12:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723850, 523280, 68256, '<td valign="top">I''m not so sure the use of pseudo HDR was a good choice here.  For some reason it just doesn''t seem to "work" for me.  I admit thought that I prefer these type photos in b/w.  With that being said it is a nice photo and does tell a story.  I''m surprised you could get so much dynamic range out of one shot.  Oh and I think it was very wise to not use a frame as the trees and stone provide that naturally...well done.  7</td>', 'I''m not so sure the use of pseudo HDR was a good choice here.  For some reason it just doesn''t seem to "work" for me.  I admit thought that I prefer these type photos in b/w.  With that being said it is a nice photo and does tell a story.  I''m surprised you could get so much dynamic range out of one shot.  Oh and I think it was very wise to not use a frame as the trees and stone provide that naturally...well done.  7', '2007-06-01 12:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723862, 524136, 68256, '<td valign="top">Some times a blown out sky really creates a strong composition, but in this case I just don''t think it works well.  It is so overpowering of your main subject.  I like the somewhat centered composition and inclusion of the stone monument (or corner of the church or whatever) on the right side. I also like your choice of saturation....matches the 1871 church very well.  6</td>', 'Some times a blown out sky really creates a strong composition, but in this case I just don''t think it works well.  It is so overpowering of your main subject.  I like the somewhat centered composition and inclusion of the stone monument (or corner of the church or whatever) on the right side. I also like your choice of saturation....matches the 1871 church very well.  6', '2007-06-01 12:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723880, 521501, 68256, '<td valign="top">That is a very strange religion.  As a Christain I like the parallel with Christ''s passion.  The car (humans) has been set free from sin (the prison in the background).  Processing is great so the colors are nice.  That blown license plate sure is distracting though.  7</td>', 'That is a very strange religion.  As a Christain I like the parallel with Christ''s passion.  The car (humans) has been set free from sin (the prison in the background).  Processing is great so the colors are nice.  That blown license plate sure is distracting though.  7', '2007-06-01 12:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723896, 523809, 68256, '<td valign="top">I like your play on words here with the title and a literal path in the woods.  I think the composition is a little boring though (sorry and that is just one persons opinion!).  Perhaps if the signs would have been more off centered and the cameral was looking down the path it would have been better.  I love the lighting and your post processing is nice. 6</td>', 'I like your play on words here with the title and a literal path in the woods.  I think the composition is a little boring though (sorry and that is just one persons opinion!).  Perhaps if the signs would have been more off centered and the cameral was looking down the path it would have been better.  I love the lighting and your post processing is nice. 6', '2007-06-01 12:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723919, 523421, 29474, '<td valign="top">Or, in the words of Just Jinjer, "peace, love, more tolerence".</td>', 'Or, in the words of Just Jinjer, "peace, love, more tolerence".', '2007-06-01 12:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723926, 523009, 68256, '<td valign="top">The overall softness doesn''t really work for me on this and I think it is because of the color noise on her forehead and under the vail.  Those areas look "splotchy" compared to the rest of the photo.  I also think it would have been better with only one person as it is hard to tell how they are being reverent.  I think if you could have reduced the noise in the areas mentioned above and selectively shapened the cross and her eyes I would have voted much higher.  As is I think it is a solid photo deserving of a 7 for the mood and tone are wonderful.</td>', 'The overall softness doesn''t really work for me on this and I think it is because of the color noise on her forehead and under the vail.  Those areas look "splotchy" compared to the rest of the photo.  I also think it would have been better with only one person as it is hard to tell how they are being reverent.  I think if you could have reduced the noise in the areas mentioned above and selectively shapened the cross and her eyes I would have voted much higher.  As is I think it is a solid photo deserving of a 7 for the mood and tone are wonderful.', '2007-06-01 12:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723978, 523090, 68256, '<td valign="top">I wished I could place my finger on why this composition isn''t working for me..I think it may be because the lighter tones aren''t closer to white.  Maybe if the white ceiling was dodged to almost white...On the shadow side of things it is really nice (which is why I''m wondering why this photo isn''t more powerful for me).  Maybe a white border would have helped also?  Anyway, I''m sorry to give you a 6 for this and not higher.  Maybe it is the people in the foreground that isn''t working....sorry I can''t put my finger on it.</td>', 'I wished I could place my finger on why this composition isn''t working for me..I think it may be because the lighter tones aren''t closer to white.  Maybe if the white ceiling was dodged to almost white...On the shadow side of things it is really nice (which is why I''m wondering why this photo isn''t more powerful for me).  Maybe a white border would have helped also?  Anyway, I''m sorry to give you a 6 for this and not higher.  Maybe it is the people in the foreground that isn''t working....sorry I can''t put my finger on it.', '2007-06-01 12:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724123, 523796, 41794, '<td valign="top">The emotion just pours out of this photo. I imagine this will score well for you.</td>', 'The emotion just pours out of this photo. I imagine this will score well for you.', '2007-06-01 13:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724131, 519119, 41794, '<td valign="top">This might benefit from being bigger for the viewers to see better.</td>', 'This might benefit from being bigger for the viewers to see better.', '2007-06-01 13:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724134, 522425, 41794, '<td valign="top">I cannot tell if that is a baby hand or a doll hand. The focus is a bit too soft.</td>', 'I cannot tell if that is a baby hand or a doll hand. The focus is a bit too soft.', '2007-06-01 13:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724137, 523239, 41794, '<td valign="top">The lighting and graininess of this photo just don''t work for me. I like the idea portrayed, but think it could use some more - just my humble opinion though.</td>', 'The lighting and graininess of this photo just don''t work for me. I like the idea portrayed, but think it could use some more - just my humble opinion though.', '2007-06-01 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724142, 522563, 41794, '<td valign="top">Wow...magnificent cathedral, and with the lens/angle you used it makes it appear even more immense. I love the muted tones throughout the photo.</td>', 'Wow...magnificent cathedral, and with the lens/angle you used it makes it appear even more immense. I love the muted tones throughout the photo.', '2007-06-01 13:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724147, 521326, 41794, '<td valign="top">I love this in black and white - that dark sky is so ominous.</td>', 'I love this in black and white - that dark sky is so ominous.', '2007-06-01 13:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724155, 523519, 41794, '<td valign="top">The very simple nature of this photo makes it very appealing. I like how the red of the church stands out against the otherwise drab colors.</td>', 'The very simple nature of this photo makes it very appealing. I like how the red of the church stands out against the otherwise drab colors.', '2007-06-01 13:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724158, 522693, 41794, '<td valign="top">Very simple and beautiful - your use of lighting on the leaf with the water droplets is perfect.</td>', 'Very simple and beautiful - your use of lighting on the leaf with the water droplets is perfect.', '2007-06-01 13:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724162, 519422, 41794, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo - very "druidic" (if that is a word?). One of my favorite shots in the challenge. I love the composition with the individual looking out over the hills - the red cape against the green landscape is great.</td>', 'Wonderful photo - very "druidic" (if that is a word?). One of my favorite shots in the challenge. I love the composition with the individual looking out over the hills - the red cape against the green landscape is great.', '2007-06-01 13:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724249, 524103, 79259, '<td valign="top">Nice form and composition.</td>', 'Nice form and composition.', '2007-06-01 14:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724264, 523133, 68256, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting composition!  First on the technicals you have done a great job.  The lighting is very natural and soft.  My only nitpick is that the main subject for me is the Bible, but it seems to be just a tad oof (very small tad!).  <br/> <br/>As for as the religious message goes, I think this has been one of the strongest yet (I haven''t seen them all yet though).  I don''t think many people will "get" the fact that as Christians we sometimes have to battle those that opress God''s people and seek to destroy that which is good...so I''m guessing your score is suffering a bit.  10</td>', 'This is a very interesting composition!  First on the technicals you have done a great job.  The lighting is very natural and soft.  My only nitpick is that the main subject for me is the Bible, but it seems to be just a tad oof (very small tad!).   As for as the religious message goes, I think this has been one of the strongest yet (I haven''t seen them all yet though).  I don''t think many people will "get" the fact that as Christians we sometimes have to battle those that opress God''s people and seek to destroy that which is good...so I''m guessing your score is suffering a bit.  10', '2007-06-01 14:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724279, 522674, 79259, '<td valign="top">Very nice light, selective focus, line. All around good.</td>', 'Very nice light, selective focus, line. All around good.', '2007-06-01 14:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
