(3724855, 523236, 68256, '<td valign="top">I almost didn''t notice the shadow..very neat capture.  This would have really been neet in an advanced challenge where you could have burned the shadow and dodged the rocks...I haven''t gone through the free study shots yet, maybe you have a version in there LOL.  Anyway, it is a great capture either way.  8</td>', 'I almost didn''t notice the shadow..very neat capture.  This would have really been neet in an advanced challenge where you could have burned the shadow and dodged the rocks...I haven''t gone through the free study shots yet, maybe you have a version in there LOL.  Anyway, it is a great capture either way.  8', '2007-06-01 16:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724865, 524220, 68256, '<td valign="top">A wedding ceremony seems out of place, but who knows maybe marriage is their religion?  I love the lighting on the upper 2/3s of the photo but the bottem seems strange to me...maybe too contrasty?  I''ve never said that before LOL.  I think a little tighter crop would have been better too so as to get rid of the slivers of window...7</td>', 'A wedding ceremony seems out of place, but who knows maybe marriage is their religion?  I love the lighting on the upper 2/3s of the photo but the bottem seems strange to me...maybe too contrasty?  I''ve never said that before LOL.  I think a little tighter crop would have been better too so as to get rid of the slivers of window...7', '2007-06-01 16:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724873, 524103, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  You''ve done the b/w conversion so well....I don''t know how in the world you got such a dark sky with high sun lighting....I''m assuming it is sunlit, but maybe it wasn''t?  Anyway, great shot capturing the shapes and textures.  10</td>', 'Very nice!  You''ve done the b/w conversion so well....I don''t know how in the world you got such a dark sky with high sun lighting....I''m assuming it is sunlit, but maybe it wasn''t?  Anyway, great shot capturing the shapes and textures.  10', '2007-06-01 16:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
