(3724917, 523756, 35044, '<td valign="top">I like this - nice abstraction.</td>', 'I like this - nice abstraction.', '2007-06-01 16:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724926, 523009, 77838, '<td valign="top">I like how you can faintly see her jawline, mouth and nose in this.  That''s what first caught my eye.</td>', 'I like how you can faintly see her jawline, mouth and nose in this.  That''s what first caught my eye.', '2007-06-01 16:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724939, 524056, 66398, '<td valign="top">There are those who are lazy and will not look up this verse. I did. I could argue that the verse says "I have come to bring fire on the earth , and how I wish it were already kindled!" But here you show it IS already kindled. Which really doesn''t interpret the verse correctly in this shot. However I am not voting on that but on the photo itself. I just wanted to point it out that''s all. You did get me to open my Bible though.. kudos for that. As far as the photo goes it looks like you "painted" with a candle which is pretty cool. The lighting on the figurine is a little too harsh imo. I don''t think your overall score at the end of the challenge is going to reflect the effort and thought it appears you put into this.</td>', 'There are those who are lazy and will not look up this verse. I did. I could argue that the verse says "I have come to bring fire on the earth , and how I wish it were already kindled!" But here you show it IS already kindled. Which really doesn''t interpret the verse correctly in this shot. However I am not voting on that but on the photo itself. I just wanted to point it out that''s all. You did get me to open my Bible though.. kudos for that. As far as the photo goes it looks like you "painted" with a candle which is pretty cool. The lighting on the figurine is a little too harsh imo. I don''t think your overall score at the end of the challenge is going to reflect the effort and thought it appears you put into this.', '2007-06-01 16:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724947, 522682, 77838, '<td valign="top">um...religion? oh, ok it''s alright.</td>', 'um...religion? oh, ok it''s alright.', '2007-06-01 16:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
