(3728904, 523976, 61552, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet it''s even better in color, but the B&amp;W adds to the concept of old age.  Good shot!  9</td>', 'I''ll bet it''s even better in color, but the B&W adds to the concept of old age.  Good shot!  9', '2007-06-02 14:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
