(3730205, 523929, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait.  Good lighting and detail, and a very interesting face.  Would like to see more of it and less of the frame, though. ;)  (If I were framing it, that is a nice proportion for matting, but for dpc, I think more picture would be nice.)</td>', 'Nice portrait.  Good lighting and detail, and a very interesting face.  Would like to see more of it and less of the frame, though. ;)  (If I were framing it, that is a nice proportion for matting, but for dpc, I think more picture would be nice.)', '2007-06-02 21:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
