(3738187, 522979, 76853, '<td valign="top">I feel it was a poor choice to use the Wiccan of symbol the five pointed star (which represents the 4 Elements ruled over by Spirit) inverted or otherwise for you''re symbol of "evil". May I suggest that next time you do your homework and not perpetuate the misinformation of Hollywood and the medieval Catholic church. Perhaps an inverted cross would be more appropriate.</td>', 'I feel it was a poor choice to use the Wiccan of symbol the five pointed star (which represents the 4 Elements ruled over by Spirit) inverted or otherwise for you''re symbol of "evil". May I suggest that next time you do your homework and not perpetuate the misinformation of Hollywood and the medieval Catholic church. Perhaps an inverted cross would be more appropriate.', '2007-06-04 18:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
