(3738614, 523425, 73601, '<td valign="top">I like your image and the dreamy soft focus.  Composition is very well done. For me the strongest part of the image is the two paths, neither leading directly to the church, for me this represents choice. Only nitpick complaints are it seems a bit dark on the left side and the leaning tree competes with the steeple, overall very nice.</td>', 'I like your image and the dreamy soft focus.  Composition is very well done. For me the strongest part of the image is the two paths, neither leading directly to the church, for me this represents choice. Only nitpick complaints are it seems a bit dark on the left side and the leaning tree competes with the steeple, overall very nice.', '2007-06-04 20:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3738625, 522674, 73601, '<td valign="top">enjoy your lighting and the crispness of her eyes. This image does not look staged which I appreciate (although it might be). You have captured an intense moment. Like the tight crop</td>', 'enjoy your lighting and the crispness of her eyes. This image does not look staged which I appreciate (although it might be). You have captured an intense moment. Like the tight crop', '2007-06-04 20:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
