(3742910, 522432, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is a very difficult shot to expose properly.  I think that you are a touch overexposed.  Some of your whites are starting to blend together.  I think that I would have tried this from a slightly higher/lower elevation in order to seperate the whites more (make them not overlap so much...)<br/>TC</td>', 'This is a very difficult shot to expose properly.  I think that you are a touch overexposed.  Some of your whites are starting to blend together.  I think that I would have tried this from a slightly higher/lower elevation in order to seperate the whites more (make them not overlap so much...)TC', '2007-06-05 18:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3742915, 522975, 9906, '<td valign="top">I love soft focus shots.  This one is just a touch too soft though.  Did you do this in camera or in post processing?<br/>TC</td>', 'I love soft focus shots.  This one is just a touch too soft though.  Did you do this in camera or in post processing?TC', '2007-06-05 18:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
