(3742923, 519465, 9906, '<td valign="top">Your focus seems to be a touch off.  The hands are more in focus then the face which makes the shot seem awkward.  This effect would be good if the hands were holding something or doing something.<br/>TC</td>', 'Your focus seems to be a touch off.  The hands are more in focus then the face which makes the shot seem awkward.  This effect would be good if the hands were holding something or doing something.TC', '2007-06-05 18:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3742934, 523929, 9906, '<td valign="top">You ruined the shot with the impressively huge border.  Is this the original crop?  You are very tight up against the left of the frame.  I would rather see the frame real estate used for more of the picture or a larger picture (more detail).<br/>TC</td>', 'You ruined the shot with the impressively huge border.  Is this the original crop?  You are very tight up against the left of the frame.  I would rather see the frame real estate used for more of the picture or a larger picture (more detail).TC', '2007-06-05 18:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
