(3744135, 523842, 22734, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here. I would have concentrated entirely on the title and then craft the image to remove anything which may distract. I would have chosen gray long sleeves so as to allow the hands to speak louder. As is, the cropping could have been brought right to the shoulder line and then clone out the light speck at the distance.  We all go through this, we have a good idea but sometimes we are unable to cash in on the presentation. 6 for good effort.</td>', 'I like the idea here. I would have concentrated entirely on the title and then craft the image to remove anything which may distract. I would have chosen gray long sleeves so as to allow the hands to speak louder. As is, the cropping could have been brought right to the shoulder line and then clone out the light speck at the distance.  We all go through this, we have a good idea but sometimes we are unable to cash in on the presentation. 6 for good effort.', '2007-06-05 23:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
