(3745181, 523102, 60862, '<td valign="top">I think this is very cool.  And I think it fit the challenge perfectly.  Well done!  I''m guessing that the DNMC crowd wouldn''t have been so harsh if the concurrent challenge was something other than science.  Folks probably thought you put it in the wrong challenge.</td>', 'I think this is very cool.  And I think it fit the challenge perfectly.  Well done!  I''m guessing that the DNMC crowd wouldn''t have been so harsh if the concurrent challenge was something other than science.  Folks probably thought you put it in the wrong challenge.', '2007-06-06 02:27:54.000000', NULL, 0),
