(3745188, 523488, 22734, '<td valign="top">Impressed me at once. Such an acute and well thought out capture and presentation. Congratulations on your  top 20 finish.</td>', 'Impressed me at once. Such an acute and well thought out capture and presentation. Congratulations on your  top 20 finish.', '2007-06-06 02:29:07.000000', NULL, 0),
