(3745194, 524017, 22734, '<td valign="top">Hey Chris: a very well executed entry! Congratulations on your top 20 finish.</td>', 'Hey Chris: a very well executed entry! Congratulations on your top 20 finish.', '2007-06-06 02:30:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3745196, 520468, 44825, '<td valign="top">I have just read the comments for this photo "post vote" and I have to say that I completely disagree with those who question the validity of the shot to the challenge.<br/> <br/>Your starting point was what you believe in - not go out and take pictures of churches.<br/> <br/>Your shot was well executed and I for one enjoyed the wit involved! well done.</td>', 'I have just read the comments for this photo "post vote" and I have to say that I completely disagree with those who question the validity of the shot to the challenge. Your starting point was what you believe in - not go out and take pictures of churches. Your shot was well executed and I for one enjoyed the wit involved! well done.', '2007-06-06 02:30:37.000000', NULL, 0),
