(3745393, 520468, 26669, '<td valign="top">thanks for all comments, however i think some people need to look at the challenge before voting to see if this meets the challenge or not.<br/> <br/>The brief was "what do you believe in?"  not get something holy and religious.<br/> <br/>Each to there own and if you don''t like the shot it self then fine but marking down as its not "Religious" is very closed minded.<br/> <br/></td>', 'thanks for all comments, however i think some people need to look at the challenge before voting to see if this meets the challenge or not. The brief was "what do you believe in?"  not get something holy and religious. Each to there own and if you don''t like the shot it self then fine but marking down as its not "Religious" is very closed minded. ', '2007-06-06 03:27:52.000000', NULL, 0),
