(3745808, 523968, 67145, '<td valign="top">i''ve just been looking thru this challenge and i''m blown away by the photographs that have beaten this one .. oh well, as i said in the thread, the harajuku girls are obviously an extremely talented bunch but totally misunderstood ... this is an excellent image ..:):)xx</td>', 'i''ve just been looking thru this challenge and i''m blown away by the photographs that have beaten this one .. oh well, as i said in the thread, the harajuku girls are obviously an extremely talented bunch but totally misunderstood ... this is an excellent image ..:):)xx', '2007-06-06 08:13:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3745815, 523070, 77196, '<td valign="top">Just for the curious, the green was leaves. I shot with fill flash, and was looking for a different than common shot of the moon on a black or star background. I deliberately left the green in, trying to convey something beyond, larger than, our normal life. I had hoped the leaves would be in focus, too, but that didn''t happen, and there was too much distance between the leaves and the moon after I cropped (which was somewhat dictated by the amount of detail I wanted visible in the moon).</td>', 'Just for the curious, the green was leaves. I shot with fill flash, and was looking for a different than common shot of the moon on a black or star background. I deliberately left the green in, trying to convey something beyond, larger than, our normal life. I had hoped the leaves would be in focus, too, but that didn''t happen, and there was too much distance between the leaves and the moon after I cropped (which was somewhat dictated by the amount of detail I wanted visible in the moon).', '2007-06-06 08:16:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3745823, 522669, 67145, '<td valign="top">wot can i say?? ... its hard enough to express our beliefs in words let alone in a photograph .. i think many ppl just took photographs of churches whether they believe or not .. good on you for doing something that you truly believe in .. it may not have scored that great, but 106 out''v 305 is pretty good when i consider the amazing talent in this site ... and by the way ... you''re one of them !!! :):)<br/><i>edit after reading more of your comment </i> .. hey .. it did heaps better than you predicted !!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-06 07:19:14.</i></td>', 'wot can i say?? ... its hard enough to express our beliefs in words let alone in a photograph .. i think many ppl just took photographs of churches whether they believe or not .. good on you for doing something that you truly believe in .. it may not have scored that great, but 106 out''v 305 is pretty good when i consider the amazing talent in this site ... and by the way ... you''re one of them !!! :):)edit after reading more of your comment  .. hey .. it did heaps better than you predicted !!!', '2007-06-06 08:17:48.000000', '2007-06-06 08:19:14.000000', 0),
