(3745968, 522674, 35357, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=64458" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">xtian</a>, it looks great on the front page!<br/>go team Trigger Happy! :-)<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Nuzzer:</b></div><hr/><i> Way to go teammate!!!!  Congrats on the blue!<br/> <br/>Team Trigger Happy has two shots on the front page at once!!!! </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Beautiful shot,  xtian, it looks great on the front page!go team Trigger Happy! :-) Originally posted by Nuzzer: Way to go teammate!!!!  Congrats on the blue! Team Trigger Happy has two shots on the front page at once!!!! ', '2007-06-06 09:12:23.000000', NULL, 0),
