(3746587, 522830, 67145, '<td valign="top">yep ... the voters have surprised me again .... this is another one that should''ve done heaps better ... its a different and excellent take on the challenge ... i''m disagreeing with the comment about the vignette .. to me it suggests a less benevolent presence hovering around, which is kept at bay by ''the shepherd'' who watches over you ..</td>', 'yep ... the voters have surprised me again .... this is another one that should''ve done heaps better ... its a different and excellent take on the challenge ... i''m disagreeing with the comment about the vignette .. to me it suggests a less benevolent presence hovering around, which is kept at bay by ''the shepherd'' who watches over you ..', '2007-06-06 11:50:36.000000', NULL, 0),
