(3747239, 523915, 60614, '<td valign="top">First off congrats on your ribbon.  Secondly, I didn''t look or vote on this challenge because I didn''t feel comfortable with the topic.  But if I had I would have given yours a 10.  You did a very nice high contrast B/W photo.  I just love the processing.  I am a big fan of B/W photos.  They always seem to have so much detail and emotion.  I can''t believe I am going to say this but I am going to have to make this one of my favorites.  You really did a great job.</td>', 'First off congrats on your ribbon.  Secondly, I didn''t look or vote on this challenge because I didn''t feel comfortable with the topic.  But if I had I would have given yours a 10.  You did a very nice high contrast B/W photo.  I just love the processing.  I am a big fan of B/W photos.  They always seem to have so much detail and emotion.  I can''t believe I am going to say this but I am going to have to make this one of my favorites.  You really did a great job.', '2007-06-06 14:22:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3747371, 523102, 53572, '<td valign="top">wow wow wow.  stunning, intersting, challenging.  well done indeed!</td>', 'wow wow wow.  stunning, intersting, challenging.  well done indeed!', '2007-06-06 14:48:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3747493, 523625, 47797, '<td valign="top">I thought you did a great job with this photo - the emotion is really carried through well - I just can''t believe you didn''t land in the top 10, sheesh, why people always vote for the same old crap is beyond me...sorry mate.</td>', 'I thought you did a great job with this photo - the emotion is really carried through well - I just can''t believe you didn''t land in the top 10, sheesh, why people always vote for the same old crap is beyond me...sorry mate.', '2007-06-06 15:13:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3747586, 523175, 78357, '<td valign="top">I liked the idea, the photo wasn''t particularly well captured, but I thought it was a mildly amusing, unconventional idea. And certainly didn''t deserve all those 1''s.<br/> <br/>Quite frankly, I think some people need to lighten up.<br/> <br/>The world is full of different people with different ideologies and in this sort of artistic arena, unless you come here with an open mind and an acceptance of that, you will always find yourself offended, especially when it comes to topics such as religion.</td>', 'I liked the idea, the photo wasn''t particularly well captured, but I thought it was a mildly amusing, unconventional idea. And certainly didn''t deserve all those 1''s. Quite frankly, I think some people need to lighten up. The world is full of different people with different ideologies and in this sort of artistic arena, unless you come here with an open mind and an acceptance of that, you will always find yourself offended, especially when it comes to topics such as religion.', '2007-06-06 15:39:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3747590, 524142, 66384, '<td valign="top">Dave, you worked hard on this and it paid off with a really nice photo. I would think this might be a good one to frame and hang. Never mind the voters.</td>', 'Dave, you worked hard on this and it paid off with a really nice photo. I would think this might be a good one to frame and hang. Never mind the voters.', '2007-06-06 15:39:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3747662, 523175, 66709, '<td valign="top">I agree with you but at the same time.  This image doesn''t fit in the challenge.  God is good getting stoned drunked drunk is evil. I know God forgive your sins but I don''t believe you can find God in the toilet!<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by CoinCounter:</b></div><hr/><i> I liked the idea, the photo wasn''t particularly well captured, but I thought it was a mildly amusing, unconventional idea. And certainly didn''t deserve all those 1''s.<br/> <br/>Quite frankly, I think some people need to lighten up.<br/> <br/>The world is full of different people with different ideologies and in this sort of artistic arena, unless you come here with an open mind and an acceptance of that, you will always find yourself offended, especially when it comes to topics such as religion. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'I agree with you but at the same time.  This image doesn''t fit in the challenge.  God is good getting stoned drunked drunk is evil. I know God forgive your sins but I don''t believe you can find God in the toilet! Originally posted by CoinCounter: I liked the idea, the photo wasn''t particularly well captured, but I thought it was a mildly amusing, unconventional idea. And certainly didn''t deserve all those 1''s. Quite frankly, I think some people need to lighten up. The world is full of different people with different ideologies and in this sort of artistic arena, unless you come here with an open mind and an acceptance of that, you will always find yourself offended, especially when it comes to topics such as religion. ', '2007-06-06 15:58:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3747768, 521511, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is a really interesting shot.  I compared it to the straight on shot and your angle adds so much depth to the pic.  I have to learn to take pics from different perspectives like this.  Very cool!</td>', 'This is a really interesting shot.  I compared it to the straight on shot and your angle adds so much depth to the pic.  I have to learn to take pics from different perspectives like this.  Very cool!', '2007-06-06 16:20:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3747778, 523261, 67697, '<td valign="top">Boo booo DQ''d - they''re out to get ya, I tell ya.  j/k lol.   Well at least you have given the rest of us a step by step DQ tutorial now so we know what to do when we feel like we need a little DQ in our system.  :)<br/> <br/>I remember what you wrote to me about your beliefs and how on earth would you visually be able to express it.  This is an excellent spiritual representation in my opinion.  The softness and the light background certainly represent that our true souls have no real or tangible form.  Just excellent!</td>', 'Boo booo DQ''d - they''re out to get ya, I tell ya.  j/k lol.   Well at least you have given the rest of us a step by step DQ tutorial now so we know what to do when we feel like we need a little DQ in our system.  :) I remember what you wrote to me about your beliefs and how on earth would you visually be able to express it.  This is an excellent spiritual representation in my opinion.  The softness and the light background certainly represent that our true souls have no real or tangible form.  Just excellent!', '2007-06-06 16:24:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3747795, 524084, 67697, '<td valign="top">Jesus!  What a great pic.  hehe<br/>Jesus!  What a great score!  Whoo now you are at 27th place to boot.<br/> <br/>Lordy that''s some awesome processing.  I got me some learning to do.<br/> <br/>Congrats on a job well done!</td>', 'Jesus!  What a great pic.  heheJesus!  What a great score!  Whoo now you are at 27th place to boot. Lordy that''s some awesome processing.  I got me some learning to do. Congrats on a job well done!', '2007-06-06 16:29:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3747803, 523654, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Congratulations on your high finish.</td>', 'Beautiful!  Congratulations on your high finish.', '2007-06-06 16:30:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3747885, 523930, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very sweet!  I like the diagonal formed by his arms and hands - gives this a solid composition.  I''d like to have seen just a wee bit more light on the side of his head, though I do like the way his hands shadow his face.</td>', 'Very sweet!  I like the diagonal formed by his arms and hands - gives this a solid composition.  I''d like to have seen just a wee bit more light on the side of his head, though I do like the way his hands shadow his face.', '2007-06-06 16:40:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(3747917, 523009, 30982, '<td valign="top">I find this very intriguing - the woman''s face, shielded, implies an Arabic religion, yet the cross a Christian one.  Very well composed.  I played with it in photoshop just a bit and if you use levels to bring up the midtones slightly, you can see just enough of her face behind the veil - her mouth, especially - that it adds yet another dimension.  I really like this take on the challenge.</td>', 'I find this very intriguing - the woman''s face, shielded, implies an Arabic religion, yet the cross a Christian one.  Very well composed.  I played with it in photoshop just a bit and if you use levels to bring up the midtones slightly, you can see just enough of her face behind the veil - her mouth, especially - that it adds yet another dimension.  I really like this take on the challenge.', '2007-06-06 16:44:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3747955, 522674, 67343, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your first ribbon and a blue, your image is beautiful. :)</td>', 'Congratulations on your first ribbon and a blue, your image is beautiful. :)', '2007-06-06 16:52:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3748004, 524080, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''ll admit I wouldn''t have gotten the analogy (didn''t vote in this challenge) as I''m not very up on religious theories and such.  As a picture, though, I think it''s very well done.  Love the textures and rich colors - quite nice!</td>', 'I''ll admit I wouldn''t have gotten the analogy (didn''t vote in this challenge) as I''m not very up on religious theories and such.  As a picture, though, I think it''s very well done.  Love the textures and rich colors - quite nice!', '2007-06-06 17:00:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3748020, 523259, 71376, '<td valign="top">lol I AM HIINDU :) ... altho i dont see no elephants LOL :)</td>', 'lol I AM HIINDU :) ... altho i dont see no elephants LOL :)', '2007-06-06 17:02:16.000000', NULL, 0);
