(3750193, 523175, 61552, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Zeuss:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by whiterook:</b></div><hr/><i> I <b>don''t know of Porcelainism</b></i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Keep looking Whiterook, you''ll find it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>This is close, but not quite Porcelainism:  Goatonapolists:<br/> <br/>//www.goatonapole.com/<br/> <br/>Besides the singular truth of the Goat''s relation to the Pole, the only thing you need to know is that the relation between Goat and Pole is the only thing you need to know.<br/> <br/>Think about it.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Zeuss: Originally posted by whiterook: I don''t know of Porcelainism  Keep looking Whiterook, you''ll find it.   This is close, but not quite Porcelainism:  Goatonapolists: //www.goatonapole.com/ Besides the singular truth of the Goat''s relation to the Pole, the only thing you need to know is that the relation between Goat and Pole is the only thing you need to know. Think about it.', '2007-06-07 01:56:58.000000', NULL, 0),
