(3750600, 523550, 77192, '<td valign="top">Post challenge: Thanks for all the comments. This is my new highest score (but then I''m only learning)<br/> <br/>I thought the people would divide opinion, I chose this pic on purpose cuz I like them :-)<br/> <br/>Looking at it again I agree it''s not totally straight, I thought I''d sorted that in editing, may be my monitor or I accidentally clicked undo or something. Ahhh well..</td>', 'Post challenge: Thanks for all the comments. This is my new highest score (but then I''m only learning) I thought the people would divide opinion, I chose this pic on purpose cuz I like them :-) Looking at it again I agree it''s not totally straight, I thought I''d sorted that in editing, may be my monitor or I accidentally clicked undo or something. Ahhh well..', '2007-06-07 05:27:16.000000', NULL, 0),
