(3754381, 522669, 68947, '<td valign="top">Michelle, I think this is a beautiful photo!  I really think that it symbolizes what this challenge was asking.  What can I say?  I think that there''s a certain "look" that voters look for in a shot and they stick that that sort of an "eye" for that "look".  Anything outside of that gets an "average score".  Quite sad, actually as this one deserved a far higher mark, given what I''m seeing of others entered into this challenge.  <br/> <br/></td>', 'Michelle, I think this is a beautiful photo!  I really think that it symbolizes what this challenge was asking.  What can I say?  I think that there''s a certain "look" that voters look for in a shot and they stick that that sort of an "eye" for that "look".  Anything outside of that gets an "average score".  Quite sad, actually as this one deserved a far higher mark, given what I''m seeing of others entered into this challenge.   ', '2007-06-07 22:32:51.000000', NULL, 0),
