(3759814, 521496, 47852, '<td valign="top">This is a nice simple shot, and I like the morning fog you captured.  If I were going to edit this, I think these would be my steps: change the crop (leaving less blacktop and a bit more room above the steeple if that was possible), desaturate just a tad (especially the yellows... they''re making the grass look a fake color), and bump the contrast up a bit (hopefully making the white of the steeple look more white and the roof a bit darker).  I also like the stained glass window at the end of the building, so perhaps an extra bit of sharpening over the windows, and probably a bit of usm on the whole shot.  I know you asked for feedback in the threads and stdavidson will give you a different type of critique.  Hopefully this will be helpful too, just in a different kind of way :)</td>', 'This is a nice simple shot, and I like the morning fog you captured.  If I were going to edit this, I think these would be my steps: change the crop (leaving less blacktop and a bit more room above the steeple if that was possible), desaturate just a tad (especially the yellows... they''re making the grass look a fake color), and bump the contrast up a bit (hopefully making the white of the steeple look more white and the roof a bit darker).  I also like the stained glass window at the end of the building, so perhaps an extra bit of sharpening over the windows, and probably a bit of usm on the whole shot.  I know you asked for feedback in the threads and stdavidson will give you a different type of critique.  Hopefully this will be helpful too, just in a different kind of way :)', '2007-06-09 10:32:14.000000', NULL, 0),
