(3765862, 523915, 51802, '<td valign="top">An amazing photograph!  Congratulations on yet another ribbon.  I''m adding this one to my favorites.</td>', 'An amazing photograph!  Congratulations on yet another ribbon.  I''m adding this one to my favorites.', '2007-06-11 01:57:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3768518, 523521, 28070, '<td valign="top">Hi Jacqueline, I just wanted to comment on your comments under the photo.  I believe the same as you.  I just read the book "The Power of Now" and it really gave me some things to think about.  <br/> <br/>The word God has been misused over the centuries so that when it is used a lot of people form a physical picture or biased opinion in there mind and don''t see that God is the stillness around us all.  The energy of the universe.  God has no form.  God is not a person.  We are all connected through God which is the energy of life.<br/> <br/>I used to get irritated when I heard people use the word God and Jesus.  Because I had formed my own picture of what I thought others thought of God.  Not so much anymore. If that makes sense.  <br/> <br/>Anyway Good picture.  Nice lighting.</td>', 'Hi Jacqueline, I just wanted to comment on your comments under the photo.  I believe the same as you.  I just read the book "The Power of Now" and it really gave me some things to think about.   The word God has been misused over the centuries so that when it is used a lot of people form a physical picture or biased opinion in there mind and don''t see that God is the stillness around us all.  The energy of the universe.  God has no form.  God is not a person.  We are all connected through God which is the energy of life. I used to get irritated when I heard people use the word God and Jesus.  Because I had formed my own picture of what I thought others thought of God.  Not so much anymore. If that makes sense.   Anyway Good picture.  Nice lighting.', '2007-06-11 15:29:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3770401, 522674, 9906, '<td valign="top"><i>Dear god,<br/>Hope you got the letter,<br/>And i pray you can make it better down here.<br/>I don''t mean a big reduction in the price of beer,<br/>But all the people that you made in your image,<br/>See them starving on their feet,<br/>''cause they don''t get enough to eat</i> <br/> <br/>XTC from the Skylarking disc</td>', 'Dear god,Hope you got the letter,And i pray you can make it better down here.I don''t mean a big reduction in the price of beer,But all the people that you made in your image,See them starving on their feet,''cause they don''t get enough to eat  XTC from the Skylarking disc', '2007-06-11 22:20:16.000000', NULL, 0),
