(3771724, 523976, 30982, '<td valign="top">A lovely old structure, well presented here.  Makes one wonder what the course of action should be - let it continue its slow but sure demise, or try maintain or rebuild it?  Congrats on the top ten!  Very hard to achieve in these here parts so it''s quite the accomplishment!</td>', 'A lovely old structure, well presented here.  Makes one wonder what the course of action should be - let it continue its slow but sure demise, or try maintain or rebuild it?  Congrats on the top ten!  Very hard to achieve in these here parts so it''s quite the accomplishment!', '2007-06-12 05:48:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3772896, 523796, 42013, '<td valign="top">I thought it was right on target and appropriate for the challenge. To strengthen th photo, I think a little interplay between the subjects may have helped. Overall, nicely done and though it didn''t score too highly, it still was in the upper part of the challenge results.</td>', 'I thought it was right on target and appropriate for the challenge. To strengthen th photo, I think a little interplay between the subjects may have helped. Overall, nicely done and though it didn''t score too highly, it still was in the upper part of the challenge results.', '2007-06-12 13:27:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3773224, 523410, 61971, '<td valign="top">Geez. Actually I am greatful for the title. Yes the picture could use some more pop. But aside from that, I would have never known what this represented without title.</td>', 'Geez. Actually I am greatful for the title. Yes the picture could use some more pop. But aside from that, I would have never known what this represented without title.', '2007-06-12 15:11:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(3775825, 523133, 10402, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from the Critique Club</b> <br/> <br/>I love the feel of this photo. Warm, yet very dynamic. And very personal. The bible is subtle, but calls attention to itself just because it is so different from everything else. And it''s placed perfectly to be the anchor for the photo; a place for the eye to rest and keep returning to as it explores the rest of the photo. Everything else is interesting; I look and enjoy the varied shapes and textures. But I don''t linger; I return to the bible to ponder what it means to me, and what it must mean to you.<br/> <br/>Technically, this is very well done. Good lighting (except for the reflection in the goggles). Perfect focus and exposure. It needs a little sharpening to bring out the details.<br/> <br/>This isn''t the kind of photo that normally does well in a challenge: too busy, and too difficult to appreciate in a couple of seconds while voting. Considering, it did very well!<br/> <br/>But I''ve very much enjoyed this photo. Great job!</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club  I love the feel of this photo. Warm, yet very dynamic. And very personal. The bible is subtle, but calls attention to itself just because it is so different from everything else. And it''s placed perfectly to be the anchor for the photo; a place for the eye to rest and keep returning to as it explores the rest of the photo. Everything else is interesting; I look and enjoy the varied shapes and textures. But I don''t linger; I return to the bible to ponder what it means to me, and what it must mean to you. Technically, this is very well done. Good lighting (except for the reflection in the goggles). Perfect focus and exposure. It needs a little sharpening to bring out the details. This isn''t the kind of photo that normally does well in a challenge: too busy, and too difficult to appreciate in a couple of seconds while voting. Considering, it did very well! But I''ve very much enjoyed this photo. Great job!', '2007-06-13 01:00:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3777059, 523740, 68035, '<td valign="top">Rob<br/> <br/>This one kinda sneaked by me...You have taken some outstanding pictures in your time, but this certainly has to be one of the best.<br/> <br/>Outstanding image, very thought provoking and beautifully sharp<br/> <br/>Brilliant pp as well<br/> <br/>All round excellence and congrats on your top 50 finish</td>', 'Rob This one kinda sneaked by me...You have taken some outstanding pictures in your time, but this certainly has to be one of the best. Outstanding image, very thought provoking and beautifully sharp Brilliant pp as well All round excellence and congrats on your top 50 finish', '2007-06-13 03:35:47.000000', NULL, 0),
