(4296285, 521635, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like it with the contrast with child, but slight motion blur in the foot I would have dock you five points. :P</td>', 'I like it with the contrast with child, but slight motion blur in the foot I would have dock you five points. :P', '2007-12-06 14:38:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4313226, 522560, 7711, '<td valign="top"><b>Note from the SC: </b>The addition of the wings in this image violates the challenge rules. This only came to our attention through the honesty of the artist; we were unaware of this prior to that. Given that the challenge was so long ago, this image will not be removed, but any user looking at this image for inspiration or precedent should not the above.</td>', 'Note from the SC: The addition of the wings in this image violates the challenge rules. This only came to our attention through the honesty of the artist; we were unaware of this prior to that. Given that the challenge was so long ago, this image will not be removed, but any user looking at this image for inspiration or precedent should not the above.', '2007-12-13 16:38:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432290, 522977, 89418, '<td valign="top">must haver been a pretty tough photo to find. Very well done</td>', 'must haver been a pretty tough photo to find. Very well done', '2008-01-28 10:23:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4453396, 523906, 14986, '<td valign="top">Pretty little pic.  Not too fancy, but more than just a snapshot.  I hope you offered the image to the church as well, as they probably would have enjoyed having it.</td>', 'Pretty little pic.  Not too fancy, but more than just a snapshot.  I hope you offered the image to the church as well, as they probably would have enjoyed having it.', '2008-02-03 11:42:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4454488, 523102, 38509, '<td valign="top">yea. great one. the theme of double helix is very interesting as a part of the photo connecting with human body ... nice work</td>', 'yea. great one. the theme of double helix is very interesting as a part of the photo connecting with human body ... nice work', '2008-02-03 17:27:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4493195, 524109, 49804, '<td valign="top">awesome shot man, really awesome emotion and really nice job with lighting and tones, great work.</td>', 'awesome shot man, really awesome emotion and really nice job with lighting and tones, great work.', '2008-02-17 21:05:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4506120, 519550, 90624, '<td valign="top">Amazing Shot!! And I love the Caption!! Keep up the good work, and God Bless</td>', 'Amazing Shot!! And I love the Caption!! Keep up the good work, and God Bless', '2008-02-22 01:21:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4630359, 520633, 92406, '<td valign="top">I can see the surrender and worship.</td>', 'I can see the surrender and worship.', '2008-04-10 14:11:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4659291, 519550, 52336, '<td valign="top">I actually enjoy cemetary memorials, and cemetaries in general.  This is appealing to me for that reason.  I like the unusual perspective given in this image, which makes it unique for a subject that is photographed often.  But in general, it''s not particularly outstanding, or compelling for any more dynamic reason.  Competent and well thought-out.</td>', 'I actually enjoy cemetary memorials, and cemetaries in general.  This is appealing to me for that reason.  I like the unusual perspective given in this image, which makes it unique for a subject that is photographed often.  But in general, it''s not particularly outstanding, or compelling for any more dynamic reason.  Competent and well thought-out.', '2008-04-25 14:58:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4659334, 519550, 85097, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very powerful and moving image.  I think even to non-christians, this image would be powerful.<br/> <br/>I think the angle of the cross gives it more of a dramatic effect and leads your eye right to the crown of thorns.</td>', 'I think this is a very powerful and moving image.  I think even to non-christians, this image would be powerful. I think the angle of the cross gives it more of a dramatic effect and leads your eye right to the crown of thorns.', '2008-04-25 16:08:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4659550, 519550, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like this image on so many levels.  Certainly, it is not outside of my comfort zone, but I felt compelled to comment on it anyway.  I don''t get a chance to see many images on dpc anymore, and miss many good ones, such as this.<br/> <br/>Personally, I find the image to project a lot of symbolism to me, though perhaps that was not intentional - the image of Christ who gave all for each and every one of us, against the wide, open sky, which to me represents the vast omnipotence of an awesome God.<br/> <br/>A well-done image that appeals to me in a deeply personal way.<br/> <br/>I also appreciate the final four sentences in your Photographer''s Comments.</td>', 'I like this image on so many levels.  Certainly, it is not outside of my comfort zone, but I felt compelled to comment on it anyway.  I don''t get a chance to see many images on dpc anymore, and miss many good ones, such as this. Personally, I find the image to project a lot of symbolism to me, though perhaps that was not intentional - the image of Christ who gave all for each and every one of us, against the wide, open sky, which to me represents the vast omnipotence of an awesome God. A well-done image that appeals to me in a deeply personal way. I also appreciate the final four sentences in your Photographer''s Comments.', '2008-04-25 18:42:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5023007, 523648, 74588, '<td valign="top">just some reality</td>', 'just some reality', '2008-10-24 01:38:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5403864, 523421, 70128, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, way toooooo many people don''t even know Africa''s shape... hey! some don''t even know where it is!!</td>', 'Unfortunately, way toooooo many people don''t even know Africa''s shape... hey! some don''t even know where it is!!', '2009-03-27 12:09:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5450455, 523133, 54398, '<td valign="top">love this picture. the title a reference to tim o'' brien''s the things they carried im assuming?</td>', 'love this picture. the title a reference to tim o'' brien''s the things they carried im assuming?', '2009-04-23 23:38:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5467123, 523102, 31637, '<td valign="top">Superb vision in creating this, lighting is excellent. What strikes me is the fact that you can''t tell whether the model is a male or female, if intended, then well done. I find the photo does fit the challenge, although science is one part of the dichotomy. Religion and science are not mutually exclusive, both are needed to validate eachother.</td>', 'Superb vision in creating this, lighting is excellent. What strikes me is the fact that you can''t tell whether the model is a male or female, if intended, then well done. I find the photo does fit the challenge, although science is one part of the dichotomy. Religion and science are not mutually exclusive, both are needed to validate eachother.', '2009-05-04 03:40:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5738195, 523648, 74588, '<td valign="top">just a reminder<br/>that religion is EVERYWHERE</td>', 'just a reminderthat religion is EVERYWHERE', '2009-11-23 13:23:06.000000', NULL, 0);
COMMIT;
